Note on FLEXPART: this repository does not contain FLEXPART source code. The
notebooks download FLEXPART from its official repository at run time and copy
its convection routines (CONVECT, TLIFT from conv_mod.f90) into a temporary
build. FLEXPART is distributed under its own licence (GNU GPL); that licence
applies to FLEXPART's code, including any build that contains it.
